# a format 11 project (32 scenes, one kit mute mask a scene): saved by that build, for the migration's test
# (tests/scenarios/migrate.xy). Run by a format 11 build (3679242): its loom_host tests/fixtures/make_v11.xy OUT
wait 300
bpm 101
wait 50
hits 1 1 1 x...x...x...x...
hits 1 1 3 ..x...x...x...x.
notes 2 1 1 1 100 C4
scenedef 2 1 1
scenedef 20 1 1
scenemute 20 .x
song 1:1 20:2 2:1
scene 20
wait 40
tap HOME
key b0 down
tapkey w2
key b0 up
wait 40
projsave 1 v11_test
storesave tests/fixtures/store_v11.bin
